NOTICE
======

This file records the copyright and license statements found in this
repository, and the paths each one covers.

The repository's own license is MIT, in `LICENSE`. Some files in this tree
carry a different license statement, and some carry none. This file reports
what those files declare, as text. It draws no conclusions beyond that.

Sections 1 to 3 were produced by reading every tracked file in the tree as it
stood when this file was added, other than the two files added by that same
change (`NOTICE` and `LICENSE-APACHE-2.0`). That was 155 files. Their counts
and file lists describe that snapshot and have not been re-derived since.

Sections 4 and 5 cover the components added by the Nicla Voice keyword
spotting demo, and were produced the same way over the files that change
adds.


